+Cover IDs use a ten-digit decimal form, `IIIIBBRRRR`. `IIII` is the
+zero-padded four-digit item ID (one million covers); `BB` is the zero-padded
+two-digit batch ID (10,000 covers); `RRRR` identifies a cover within the batch.
+For example, cover `8,010,042` is `0008010042` in item `0008`, batch `01`.
 
